### 1. INITIALISATION : Vérifier le stock initial de P001
GET http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/crm/Products(ID='P001')?$select=name,stockLevel
Authorization: Basic alice:


### ============================================================
### PHASE 1 : CYCLE ACHAT (SRM) - Augmenter le stock
### ============================================================

### 2. Créer une Demande d'Offre (RFQ)
# @name createRFQ
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/srm/RFQs
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "supplier_ID": "10000002",
    "rfqDate": "2026-05-14",
    "totalAmount": 500000.00,
    "currency_code": "DZD",
    "items": [
        { "product_ID": "P001", "quantity": 10, "price": 50000.00 }
    ]
}

### 3. Convertir RFQ en Bon de Commande (PO)
# Remplacer l'ID par celui retourné au point 2
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/srm/RFQs(ID=d6e87f8a-9a9b-4e8a-8a8a-8a8a8a8a8a8a,IsActiveEntity=true)/SRMService.convertToPO
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4. Réception des Marchandises (Goods Receipt) -> C'est ici que le stock augmente
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/srm/GoodsReceipts
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "purchaseOrder_ID": "b7d1c6e5-4f3a-4e2a-9a9a-9a9a9a9a9a9a",
    "deliveryDate": "2026-05-14",
    "receivedBy": "Mouloud"
}

### 5. Vérifier que le stock de P001 a AUGMENTÉ (+10)
GET http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/crm/Products(ID='P001')?$select=stockLevel
Authorization: Basic alice:


### ============================================================
### PHASE 2 : CYCLE VENTE (CRM) - Diminuer le stock
### ============================================================

### 6. Créer un Devis Client (Quote)
# @name createQuote
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/crm/Quotes
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_ID": "10000001",
    "quoteDate": "2026-05-14",
    "totalAmount": 180000.00,
    "currency_code": "DZD",
    "items": [
        { "product_ID": "P001", "quantity": 2, "price": 90000.00 }
    ]
}

### 7. Convertir Devis en Commande (Sales Order) -> C'est ici que le stock diminue
# Remplacer l'ID par celui retourné au point 6
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/crm/Quotes(ID=c5a9b8c7-d6e5-4f3a-a1b2-c3d4e5f6a7b8,IsActiveEntity=true)/CRMService.convertToOrder
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Vérifier que le stock de P001 a DIMINUÉ (-2)
GET http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/crm/Products(ID='P001')?$select=stockLevel
Authorization: Basic alice:


### 9. Générer la Facture Client
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/crm/SalesOrders(ID=f1e2d3c4-b5a6-4f7e-8d9c-0a1b2c3d4e5f,IsActiveEntity=true)/CRMService.generateInvoice
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ============================================================
### PHASE 3 : ANALYTICS
### ============================================================

### 10. Voir les KPIs de ventes
GET http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/analytics/SalesView
Authorization: Basic alice:
